@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed current-authority protected retrieval
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Viewer
participant "Sharing handler" as S
database "Current link / viewer / mode state" as DB
participant "Presentation contract" as P
participant "Files / controlled serving" as F
Viewer -> S : requested link / variant / language / viewer context
S -> DB : resolve current eligibility + generation + configuration
DB --> S : current scoped state or denial
S -> P : resolve permitted publication + selected content
P --> S : exact manifest identity or unavailable
S -> DB : resolve exact matching rendition / uploaded association
DB --> S : available / processing / failed / unavailable
alt eligible context + permitted variant + usable artifact
 S -> F : resolve protected artifact + delivery guard
 F --> S : exact usable identity or unavailable
 S -> S : guarded admission against current relevant versions
 S -> F : admit scoped controlled delivery
 F --> Viewer : permitted bytes
else denied / unavailable
 S --> Viewer : safe accurate result; no private fallback
end
note over S,F
 Concrete synchronization must cover revocation / mode / revision races.
 Later full, range and cache requests need applicable current checks.
 Already emitted or downloaded bytes cannot be recalled.
end note
@enduml
